               ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on union_parent union_parent_1
         ->  Custom Scan (TessFilter) on union_child union_parent_2
               Batch Filter: (union_parent_2.b < 3)
               ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on union_child union_parent_2
(8 rows)

