                                             Output: union_keys.c, union_keys.b
                           ->  Custom Scan (TessPack)
                                 Output: unnamed_subquery_1.c, unnamed_subquery_1.b
                                 Rows Kept As: forwarded batches
                                 ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessFilter) on public.union_keys union_keys_1
                                       Output: union_keys_1.c, union_keys_1.b
                                       Batch Filter: (union_keys_1.b > 3)
                                       ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on public.union_keys union_keys_1
                                             Output: union_keys_1.c, union_keys_1.b
